affiliated with Anthropic.

No keys, no secrets
-------------------
This repository ships with NO API keys or secrets. The default voice
guidance ("homing" mode) runs with no keys. An optional walking-directions
provider key, if used, is supplied by the operator via environment/config
and is never committed to this repository.

